                "text": "LI has one of the highest breast cancer rates in the nation. That's why I\u2019m committed to promoting research & early detection and why I've intro'd a bill to ensure timely care for metastatic breast cancer patients. Together, we can make a difference. #BreastCancerAwarenessMonth https://t.co/HgNZE8fp4M",
