                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "For patients with Metastatic Breast Cancer, every moment counts. \n\nThat\u2019s why today I reintroduced the Metastatic Breast Cancer Access to Care Act to eliminate waiting periods for SSDI & Medicare coverage, ensuring those with MBC get the care they need when they need it. \n\nLearn more\u27a1\ufe0f https://t.co/5Eu50eUA82",
